804	      // Same integrity problem as adminExtendServer, and the same answer: taking a
805	      // server OFF free hands it a 30-day term nobody paid for, so record the whole
806	      // window as gifted (100% off) and no proration can pay it out. Not blended —
807	      // this REPLACES `expiresAt` outright rather than extending it, so there are no
808	      // prior paid months left in the window to preserve.
